From 3f98e743e8ea0411625e48e01e42bebc8fcd3563 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Karthik S <karthik@example.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 15:42:59 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] pipewire-plugin: add FNN+ DOA polling via PipeWire metadata

Poll PAL_PARAM_ID_FNN_PLUS_DOA_ESTIMATE_MONITOR_WITH_TIMESTAMP on a
100ms timer for capture-only streams and publish the result as
properties on a new 'fnn-doa' PipeWire metadata object.

Clients can toggle polling via fnn.doa.enable and adjust the cadence
via fnn.doa.interval_ms metadata keys.

Depends-on: AudioReach/audioreach-pal#111
CRs-Fixed: 4730709

Cherry-picked from AudioReach/audioreach-pipewire-plugin#47
---
 Makefile.am         |   2 +-
 configure.ac        |   3 +
 src/pw-pal-plugin.c | 250 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 254 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

